# Exam track — Theme: Medien & Technologie — Sub-lesson 1: Vocabulary
# Sproochentest oral-exam topic. Target level ~B1 (authoring guideline only).
#
# Sentences are grounded in the user's real answers, gathered by interview —
# do not "improve" or genericize them in a later editing pass.

@lesson D1.01 "Media Vocabulary"

@word d'Medien = the media
@word d'Noriichten = the news
@word d'Aktualitéit = current events
@word d'Zeitung = the newspaper
@word d'Zäitschrëft = the magazine
@word d'Websäit = the website
@word d'Buch = the book
@word d'Bicher = the books
@word d'Héierbuch = the audiobook
@word de Radio = the radio
@word de Podcast = the podcast
@word de Fernsee = the television
@word d'Tëlee = the TV
@word de Kanal = the channel
@word d'Sendung = the broadcast
@word d'Reklamm = the advertisement
@word den Internet = the internet
@word d'Netzwierk = the network
@word den Handy = the mobile phone
@word de Computer = the computer
@word de Laptop = the laptop
@word den Tablet = the tablet
@word de Bildschierm = the screen
@word d'App = the app
@word d'Technologie = the technology
@word de Message = the message
@word d'Telefonsnummer = the phone number
@word den Uruff = the phone call
@word de Bäitrag = the post
@word d'Foto = the photo
@word de Bréif = the letter
@word d'Postkaart = the postcard
@word liesen = to read
@word schreiwen = to write
@word lauschteren = to listen
@word kucken = to watch
@word benotzen = to use
@word telefonéieren = to phone

@sentence
@lu Ech liesen d'Noriichten all Moien um Internet.
@en Every morning I read the news on the internet.
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@distractor-lu Bréif
@distractor-en advertisement
@distractor-en letter

@sentence
@lu Mäin Handy ass ëmmer roueg.
@en My mobile phone is always silent.
@distractor-lu Laptop
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-en laptop
@distractor-en television

@sentence
@lu Ech lauschteren en Héierbuch am Auto.
@en I listen to an audiobook in the car.
@distractor-lu Zeitung
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@distractor-en newspaper
@distractor-en advertisement

@sentence
@lu Meng Fra an ech schécke gär Postkaarten.
@en My wife and I like sending postcards.
@distractor-lu Bréiwer
@distractor-lu Bäiträg
@distractor-en letters
@distractor-en posts

@sentence
@lu Ech schreiwen all Dag vill Message.
@en I write a lot of messages every day.
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-lu Zäitschrëften
@distractor-en books
@distractor-en magazines

@sentence
@lu De Podcast ass op Ukrainesch a ganz interessant.
@en The podcast is in Ukrainian and very interesting.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en boring
